    "font size" : 6.968,
    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "Life is the “ultimate unreliable narrator”.Thatisoneofthegreeting card-style nuggets of wisdom shared in Dan Fogelman’s trite andmanipulativesaga. Fogelman is one of many film-"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 86,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 330.0, 503.333, 428.667, 569.333 ],
