    "font size" : 6.968,
    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "Vincent is a grizzled and menacing ﬁgure but one prey to selfpity, too. Like most of the others here, he has been bruised emotionally by horriﬁc childhood experiences. We can’t tell whether he wants to help Javier or steal Isabel. At least Banderas brings somecharisma tohis role. In an otherwise bland affair,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
