    "content" : "throughthe1890sandearly1900s. Midway through, the film turns brieﬂyintoafarce as bothColette and Willy become enraptured by Georgie Raoul-Duval (Eleanor Tomlinson), a bisexual “wayward debutantefromLouisiana”. Colette is far too strong a char-"
