    "content" : "sequence. It is full of flashbacks and leaps into the future. Will is showninsessionswithatherapist (Annette Bening), failing to pull himself together. In one scene, the sweet-natured ﬁgure from earlier has turned into a raging, drunken, disturbedhobo."
  }, {
