    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "Keira Knightley plays aspiring author Colette as a passionate and fiercely independent figure. She is looking to establish an artistic identity of her own at a time when patriarchal wisdom has it that“ladywritersdon’tsell”.First seenasa19-year-oldin1892,sheis a young woman without a dowry oranyobviousprospects. Colette may seem demure but"
