    "content" : "that doesn’t stop her from having sex in the barn with the much older Henry Gauthier-Villars (known as “Willy”), a city slicker who served in the army with her father. Willy (Dominic West), who eventually becomes her husband, lures her from home to live in a Paris “heaving with artists and"
