    "content" : "small part of its subject’s story, longbefore she wrote Gigi .Thisis the author in her formative years, and as a portrait of an artist as a young woman, the ﬁlm is intriguing,Knightley excellinginthetitle role. But, as drama, it feels a little under-charged. THE INDEPENDENT"
